{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37624","headline":"西蜀净衆寺松溪八韵兼寄小笔崔处士 · 郑谷","name":"西蜀净衆寺松溪八韵兼寄小笔崔处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松因溪得名，溪吹荅松声。\n缭绕能穿寺，幽奇不在城。\n寒烟斋後散，春雨夜中平。\n染岸苍苔古，翘沙白鸟明。\n澄分僧影瘦，光彻客心清。\n带梵侵云响，和钟击石鸣。\n澹烹新茗爽，暖泛落花轻。\n此景吟难尽，凭君画入京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}